---
---
<section id="general-process" class="pt-12 md:pt-24 pb-8 md:pb-12 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white mb-4 tracking-tight">How it works</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">Every case is different, so we start with yours.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-4 bottom-4 w-[2px] bg-slate-800 -translate-x-1/2"></div>

      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-8 md:mb-14 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%] text-right pr-2 sm:pr-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 1: You</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">Tell us your situation</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Message us on WhatsApp, use the contact form or book a call. Tell us where you are and what you need.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">1</div>
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-8 md:mb-14 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-800 text-white border-2 border-blue-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">2</div>
        <div class="w-[45%] text-left pl-2 sm:pl-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-400 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 2: taxomade</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">We review your case</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">We look at your individual situation, ask about anything that is missing and tell you exactly what applies to you and what it costs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-8 md:mb-14 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%] text-right pr-2 sm:pr-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 3: You</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">You confirm</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">You give us the go and send the documents we ask for. That is usually all you need to do.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm">3</div>
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex flex-row items-center justify-between mb-8 md:mb-14 w-full">
        <div class="w-[45%]"></div>
        <div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white border-2 border-emerald-500 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold z-10 shadow-sm"><svg class="w-3 h-3 sm:w-4 sm:h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div>
        <div class="w-[45%] text-left pl-2 sm:pl-0">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/50 text-emerald-400 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 sm:mb-3">Step 4: taxomade</div>
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1 sm:mb-2 leading-tight">We prepare and file everything</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">Registrations, filings and ongoing bookkeeping, handled in English by our state-certified Greek accountant. We reply within hours, 7 days a week.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Notice -->
    <div class="mt-10 md:mt-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 inline-block mr-1 -mt-0.5 text-slate-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        The detailed process for each specific service can be found on the respective <a href="#how-it-works" class="font-bold text-white underline hover:text-blue-400">service pages</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
